--[==[
  Player Data Replication -- profile loading, datastore reconciliation and client replication

  Player data replication - profile load, reconcile, replicate.

  Handles the datastore read on join, reconciles against the session cache,
  and pushes deltas to clients through the replication bridge. Retries are
  capped because the datastore itself rate limits; an unbounded retry loop
  here will get the whole experience throttled.

  Never write to a profile from the client path.

  subsystems
    data.repl              replication bridge
    data.store             datastore bridge
    data.profile           profile store

  configuration
    store.retryCap               = 4          -- platform rate limit
    profile.schemaVersion        = 5          -- bump on migration

  known failure codes
    E_DATA_6733      session expired while profile was held
    E_DATA_6644      schema migration unsupported

  history
    v4.1.3 - retry cap lowered to 4 after platform throttling incidents
    v4.0.6 - session heartbeat now renews on any inbound remote
    v4.0.0 - profile locking moved into the store bridge
]==]
